      trigger_capability: "the field-projection arm of the optionality relation: extend optional_at_required_obligation_diags (src/v1/04_infer.dag) so a field read THROUGH an optional is decided at the PROJECTION position, the way the direct call-argument position already decides it. WHEN THIS FIRES: the twin leg #test.claim.guarantee_floor_class_probe_witness::floor_cardinality_seam_field_projection_through_optional_is_still_silent stops being a silent acceptance and becomes a refusal, and is re-ranked as a regression control beside its discriminating call-argument refusal; it is never deleted while it is still green, because deleting a green hole leg is how a hole becomes invisible." as NonEmptyStr,
    },
