  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a record declares a field with optional cardinality (parent: Level?), and a dot projection reads a field THROUGH that optional value (l.parent.id). Absent carries no fields, so the read has no meaning on that branch; v1.compiler.infer ACCEPTS the read and the whole program with zero diagnostics, producing the field type THROUGH the optional (String? here) as if the projection were total.",
